/* Concise settings descriptions and navigation */
"Retain more experts to reduce SSD reads, at the cost of memory. Applies on next load." = "保留更多专家以减少 SSD 读取，但会增加内存用量。下次加载生效。";
"May speed up generation, but uses more memory and can be slower for some requests." = "可能加快生成，但会增加内存用量，部分请求反而较慢。";
"Reject weak drafts earlier, but fewer accepted drafts may reduce the speed gain. 0 keeps all drafts." = "调高可提早排除低置信度草稿，但可能减少加速效果。0 保留所有草稿。";
"May speed up generation, but answer quality may drop. Unavailable with MTP or DSpark." = "可能加快生成，但回答质量可能下降。无法与 MTP 或 DSpark 同时使用。";
"Save memory, but compression adds work and may slightly affect answer quality." = "节省内存，但压缩会增加运算，回答质量可能略受影响。";
"Reduce cache quantization error, but may use more memory." = "减少缓存量化误差，但可能增加内存用量。";
"May shorten prefill, but needs extra memory and may slightly change output." = "可能缩短 prefill 时间，但需要额外内存，输出可能略有差异。";
"More ANE work may shorten prefill, but adds memory use and may change output. 0 uses GPU only." = "调高可能缩短 prefill 时间，但会增加内存用量，输出可能略有差异。0 仅使用 GPU。";
"Shorten prefill, but peak memory may rise and output may differ slightly." = "缩短 prefill 时间，但内存峰值可能上升，输出可能略有差异。";
"Shorten prefill, but may use more memory. Requires layer-major prefill with MTP off." = "缩短 prefill 时间，但可能增加内存用量。需启用 layer-major prefill 并关闭 MTP。";
"Larger batches may shorten prefill, but raise peak memory. 0 selects automatically." = "调高可能缩短 prefill 时间，但会提高内存峰值。0 为自动选择。";
"Avoid whole-layer overhead on shorter prompts, but fewer prompts benefit from faster prefill." = "调高可减少短输入的整层加载开销，但较少请求能享有 prefill 加速。";
"Reduce SSD waiting, but may need more temporary memory." = "减少等待 SSD 的时间，但可能需要更多临时内存。";
"More workers may reduce SSD waiting, but use more memory; too many can slow things down." = "调高可能减少 SSD 等待，但会增加内存用量，过多反而可能变慢。";
"Off saves memory but repeats work. Memory reuses quickly but clears on unload. Disk survives restarts but adds I/O." = "不使用：省内存，但每次重算。内存：复用快，但卸载后清除。磁盘：重启后可用，但增加读写。";
"Keep more conversation history to shorten repeated prefill, at the cost of memory." = "调高可保留更多对话缓存、缩短重复输入的等待，但会增加内存用量。";
"LRU adapts quickly but forgets older use. LFU favors frequent use but adapts slowly. Route-aware balances layers but adds bookkeeping." = "LRU：适应快，但易忘记较早使用。LFU：保留常用专家，但适应慢。路由感知：平衡各层，但增加管理开销。";
"Speed up attention search, but limiting candidates may affect output." = "加快注意力搜索，但限制候选范围可能影响输出。";
"Shorten prefill and reduce temporary memory; full-model validation is still limited." = "缩短 prefill 时间并减少临时内存，但完整模型验证仍有限。";
"Allow longer answers, but generation may take more time and memory." = "调高可容纳更完整的回答，但生成可能更久、内存用量更多。";
"Increase answer variety, but responses may be less consistent." = "调高可增加回答变化，但稳定性可能降低。";
"Consider more candidates for varied answers, but responses may be less focused. 0 removes the limit." = "调高可增加候选与回答变化，但可能较不聚焦。0 不限制候选数。";
"Choose sampling for chat or thinking automatically, overriding the manual values below." = "自动选择适合对话或思考的采样设置，但会取代下方手动值。";
"A higher guideline may reduce waiting, but allows more memory use. 0 is automatic; too little memory can fail requests." = "调高可能减少等待，但允许更多内存用量。0 为自动；内存不足可能导致请求失败。";
"Prepare matching prompts for faster reuse, but add startup time and cache memory." = "预先准备相符输入以加快复用，但会增加启动时间与缓存用量。";
"Save cache memory, but packing and unpacking may slow processing." = "节省缓存内存，但打包与解包可能增加处理时间。";
