"Qwen Flash experiments" = "Qwen Flash 实验功能";
"Experimental; full-model speed and quality are not yet verified. All four controls default to off or mmap." = "实验性功能；尚未验证完整模型的速度与质量。这四个控件默认均为关闭或 mmap。";
"Saved automatically for this model. Changes apply on the next model load. Unload the model before editing." = "设置会按模型自动保存，并于下次加载模型时生效。修改前请先卸载模型。";
"Unload this model to edit these settings. Loading and unloading also lock the controls." = "请先卸载此模型再修改设置。加载与卸载过程中也无法修改。";
"Experts per wave" = "每波专家数";
"0 disables waves; 1–512 limits the experts acquired per wave, capped by the expert cache. This is not a total memory limit. Small waves may be slower." = "0 关闭分波；1–512 限制每波获取的专家数，且不超过专家缓存容量。这不是总内存上限；较小的波次可能更慢。";
"Expert waves temporarily disable whole-layer batching, next-layer prefetch, and grouped prefill. Their saved choices are restored when waves are disabled." = "专家分波会暂时禁用整层批次计算、下一层预读与分组 prefill。关闭分波后会恢复这些选项原先保存的设置。";
"N-gram read backend" = "N-gram 读取方式";
"mmap is the default. Buffered pread reads selected rows explicitly; it is not direct SSD-to-GPU I/O and may be slower." = "默认为 mmap。使用缓冲的 pread 会明确读取所选数据行；这不是 SSD 直接传送至 GPU，也可能更慢。";
"mmap (default)" = "mmap（默认）";
"pread (experimental)" = "pread（实验性）";
"N-gram row cache MiB" = "N-gram 数据行缓存 MiB";
"0 disables retention; 1–512 MiB retains packed FP8 rows with pread. Metadata, temporary buffers and the OS page cache are extra. The saved size is inactive with mmap." = "0 不保留缓存；1–512 MiB 在 pread 模式保留 packed FP8 数据行。不含元数据、临时缓冲区与系统页面缓存。切回 mmap 时保留设置值，但不使用这份缓存。";
"Use fused QSA SDPA" = "使用融合 QSA SDPA";
"Uses the same selected attention cells with a fused kernel. Floating-point rounding and generated text may differ; a speed improvement is not guaranteed." = "以融合内核处理相同的注意力选取位置。浮点舍入与生成文字可能不同，且不保证加速。";
"Experts per wave must be an integer from 0 to 512." = "每波专家数必须为 0 至 512 的整数。";
"Choose mmap or pread for the N-gram read backend." = "N-gram 读取方式请选择 mmap 或 pread。";
"N-gram row cache must be an integer from 0 to 512 MiB." = "N-gram 数据行缓存必须为 0 至 512 MiB 的整数。";

"Compile Qwen tensor operations" = "编译 Qwen 张量运算";
"Compiles grouped normalization and single-token hyper-connection operations. Multi-token batches keep the original mixing path. Rounding and generated text may change." = "编译分组归一化与单 token 的超连接运算。多 token 批次保留原本的混合路径。浮点舍入与生成文本可能改变。";
